  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "What could they have run into way out here?@Lamaris? Or the <Zovorg>?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "...Maybe it's somebody@who's after the same thing we are.",
