   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Don't worry, Serena.@It's called ladies first.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "...All right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "D-Don't tell me Albada is doing this@to let us get away...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "We fought <Volkruss> and <Meckennoza>@and survived. This time's no different.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "But that time, Dr. Shirakawa and the others...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Stop overthinking it!@We're breaking through here, no matter what!@On our own!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Gwaah...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Al!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "I'm fine, this is nothing!@Compared to fighting <Meckennoza>, it's a breeze!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Quit acting tough! With that much damage...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Just go!@If you don't break through, we'll never@make it to the captain and the others!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Al...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "I said go!@I've got no intention of croaking here either!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "(That's right, Serena... Not until you're safe!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Ugh, ngh... N-Not yet...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Al!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "I'll send you to join your comrades too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Al, we're pulling out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "You got it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Don't think you can escape!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Th-This is... It's no... use, huh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "A-Al!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "L-Listen, Serena...@Don't go... getting... revenge...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Let... it go... A mission's... a mission...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "R-Revenge... won't bring... anything..........",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Aaaaaaaal!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "...So you're the only one left?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Th-The only ones...?@Th-Then the captain and the others...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "I wonder if there are any bodies left to identify.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "You!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "You did thiiis!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "No! Please, disengage!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Elma!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "If they get you too, Serena,@then Team Jelba really will be finished!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "You're telling me to run away by myself?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "That's... what Albada wanted.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Ngh...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Hmph, I thought she'd come at us...@All units, pursue.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Serena, if we keep this up,@I think we can get away!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Wh-Why are you slowing down?!@The enemy's going to catch up!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Serena, what are you thinking?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "...Isn't it obvious?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "I see... So you meant to draw me away alone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Elma, calculate how long until@the enemy's reinforcements catch up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "That's crazy!@The Gestorben can't beat her in its current state!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "How long until the reinforcements catch up?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Did you forget what Albada said?!@Don't get revenge, revenge won't...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Won't bring anything...@Yeah, maybe that's true. But... But...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Words like that can't settle this!@She killed Al! She killed my comrades!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "What am I supposed to do with this grief and rage?!@Is there any way to settle this besides revenge?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "S-Serena...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "No, there isn't!@I will never forgive that woman!@I'll kill her with my own hands!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "It's hopeless, Serena!@Enemy reinforcements arrive in 30 seconds!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "So my defeat is sealed, huh...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Let's run as far as we can at full speed,@then abandon the unit! That way...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "That woman is sure she's already won...!@That's where she'll slip up!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Whaaat!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "Now, I'll shatter it all, your feelings and your life!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Uaaaaaaagh!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "M-My mask...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "I-It didn't reach...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "You, how dare you! My face!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "You saw my faaaaace!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Ugh, the controls...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "There was another unit nearby...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Lyeta",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "...Looks like we made it just in time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Vesner",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Yeah, it seems our allies weren't@completely wiped out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "That unit over there has a damaged cockpit.@Let's finish it. I don't want to get shot in the back!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "No, it seems things won't be that convenient.@Enemy reinforcements are here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Unidentified Soldier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Vice Captain.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "...Ein. I can't move anymore.@Lend me a hand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "I'm falling back. The rest of you, annihilate the enemy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Tch, the commander's unit got away.@And I could've padded my kill score so easily.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "If you want to rack up your score,@I don't think you'll be short on prey.@Though it doesn't look easy at all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "Well, for now, let's save a life, not herald a death.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Yeah... I want to save the lives we can.@Besides, a fellow Gestorben pilot... It must be fate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "(As befits a unit with such an ominous name,@it seems the Gestorben's stars doom its pilots@to a harsh fate...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "We're not fully armed, and we've got a wounded pilot...@How are we getting out of this?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "That's...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "This ID code... It's a <Steel Dragons> unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "This is Major Kai Kitamura of the Steel Dragons.@We detected fighting here and rushed over.@Are you the 13th Special Operations PT Unit?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "Yes. Captain Vesner Skerrit@and Lieutenant Lyeta Weaver.@Thank you for coming to our aid.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "Major Phillips told me about you.@Where's that red Gestorben from?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "According to its ID code, the 5th Special Operations@PT Unit, Team Jelba. The pilot appears to be@seriously injured.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Then take that unit and fall back.@Our flagship, the Hagane, is headed this way too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Understood.@...Let's go, Lyeta.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "Roger.@Lucky you, red Gestorben pilot.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units! Commence attack!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "...Is it over?@Eleve 1 to all units. We're returning to the Hagane!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "Hagane - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "...Never thought we'd end up landing on the Hagane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "Come to think of it, you were saved by them once too,@back in the <L5 Campaign>, weren't you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Right in the middle of <Operation SRW>.@If not for that, I'd have become a real dead man@before I ever became a fake one.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "Hm? Did you just say \"too\"?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "Yeah. When I was fighting the <Aerogators> in Beijing,@their reinforcements saved me once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "Huh, that's the first I've heard of it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "U-Um! The pilot of the red Gestorben@that was just brought in...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "They took her to intensive care.@She's unconscious, and they say it's still@too early to tell if she'll make it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "No... Oh, Lieutenant Serena...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "You know her?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "Y-Yes... We were together in <The Sealing War>...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "Reassurances won't help much, but I think@she's got the devil's own luck.@She heard the Deathbird's wings and survived.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "The Deathbird...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "Like Vesner said,@Gestorben pilots don't die that easily.@That's how it was for us, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "...So, um... Besides Lieutenant Serena...@weren't any of the other Team Jelba members@at the scene?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "No, I didn't see any.@When we arrived, the red Gestorben@was fighting on its own.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "(We didn't have time to check whether the wreckage@around us was friend or foe, though.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "I see...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "If only the <Sabot> riding with her had made it,@we could've asked it all kinds of things.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "The Sabot...?@You mean Elma was destroyed?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "Yeah. Same as the Gestorben,@there's nothing to be done unless@it goes back to the manufacturer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "(It looks like the same series of Sabot as ours,@so I hope its AI survived somehow.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "...I-I understand.@I'm going to intensive care! Excuse me!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "...I wonder what happened to the rest.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "We'll know soon enough once the others arrive.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "Oh, here comes Major Kai.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "...So it's on your mind after all, Hugo.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "Yes. Her situation is a lot like mine...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "Major Kai.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "Good work, Captain Vesner.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "Sir.@This is my colleague, Lieutenant Lyeta Weaver.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "Thanks for the help earlier, Major.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "Your colleague, not your subordinate?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "Yes. I'm no longer the captain of the@7th Special Operations PT Unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "I see. The FDX Team was disbanded.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "Major, who's this?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "Lieutenant Hugo Medio,@<Special Tactics Instructor Unit>. I used to belong to@the 3rd Special Operations PT Unit.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "The 3rd... That's the Cry Wolves.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "I'm its last survivor.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "Huh? Haven't we met somewhere before?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 423,
   "en": "No, I don't recall.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 424,
   "en": "Oh...@I could've sworn I'd seen you somewhere.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 425,
   "en": "(It wouldn't be strange if she had.@Like us back then, the Cry Wolves@were stationed at Aviano Base.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 426,
   "en": "(Then again, we were always in hiding back then,@so there's no way they'd remember us...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 427,
   "en": "Captain, I hear you two will stay at the@Garden of Baral ruins in our place.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 428,
   "en": "Yes. Lyeta and I are the advance team.@The main force should arrive soon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 429,
   "en": "All right. We're counting on you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 430,
   "en": "The pleasure's mine.@I'm glad I got to meet@the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 431,
   "en": "Paris - Earth Federation Army Joint Staff HQ",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 432,
   "en": "Earth Federation Army Joint Staff HQ",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 433,
   "en": "Gaspar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 434,
   "en": "Hmm... It seems I'll have to rewrite@the draft of my declaration that@the Lamaris Unrest is over.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 435,
   "en": "Daniel",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 436,
   "en": "Strictly speaking, it's not an emergency yet.@We've only observed signs@that it could become one.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 437,
   "en": "Assuming another <Cross Gate Burst> occurs...@when would it be?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
